#: install.php:15
msgid ""
"Allow Dynamic Members of a Queue to login or logout. See the Queues Module "
"for how to assign a Dynamic Member to a Queue."
msgstr "允許佇列的動態成員登入或登出。請參閱佇列模組以了解如何將動態成員指派給佇列。"

#: views/form.php:191
msgid "Always"
msgstr "永遠"

#: views/form.php:386
